  "source_code": "import sys\r\ninput=sys.stdin.readline\r\nM=998244353\r\nN=200000\r\nh=[0]*(N+1)\r\nfor i in range(1,N+1):\r\n    h[i]=(h[i-1]+pow(i,M-2,M))%M \r\n    \r\nfor _ in range(int(input())):\r\n    n=int(input()); a=map(int,input().split())\r\n    print(sum(x*(h[i]+h[n-1-i]) for i,x in enumerate(a))%M)",
